flowchart TD
    REF["refresh"] --> FETCH{fetch ok?}
    FETCH -->|yes| WRITE{write ok?}
    FETCH -->|no| CACHE{cache present?}
    WRITE -->|yes| OK["Success: Room re-emits"]
    WRITE -->|disk full| DISK["DiskFull: keep old data"]
    CACHE -->|yes| ERRC["Error with cached data"]
    CACHE -->|no| ERRE["Error empty + Retry"]
